<title>UK: CWC appoints human resources director. [CORRECTED 11:41 GMT]</title>
<headline>CWC appoints human resources director. [CORRECTED 11:41 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline and the text to make clear that Martin Hayton is joining Cable and Wireless Communications Plc, not Cable and Wireless Plc.)</p>
<p>Cable and Wireless Communications Plc said on Friday that Martin Hayton will become human resources director at the company with effect from March 1.</p>
<p>Hayton is currently human resources director for Hong Kong Telecommunications Ltd.</p>
<p>C&amp;W Communications was formed by the merger of Cable and Wireless Plc's Mercury unit, Nynex Corp's NYNEX CableComms Group, Bell Cablemedia Plc and Videotron Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
